/// Update a scheduledCall row (read-merge-validate-write). @serverOnly for createCallsScheduledCall's reason. Only the fields that change over a scheduledCall's life are accepted: its site, owner and calendar UID never move, and its two digests move only when a reschedule mints new links, which is what makes the old links open nothing. actor.userId scoping is not the fix: the calls integration runs as the site owner or the cluster, so a caller term would decide nothing, and what @serverOnly withholds is the WIRE.
@serverOnly
mutation scheduledCall updateCallsScheduledCall {
  args {
